      "alt": "Winding mountain road disappearing into thick white mist surrounded by tall dark pine trees",
      "caption": "The Teesta Valley road at dusk, where the family bus had broken down in July thirty-six years earlier.",
      "imageSize": "portrait",
      "imageWidth": 1200,
      "imageHeight": 1800
