      "alt": "A lone house covered in deep winter snow at dusk",
      "caption": "The winter twilight in Mississauga, where Subhash remembered the Kurseong ridge.",
      "imageSize": "portrait",
      "imageWidth": 1200,
      "imageHeight": 1800
